{% extends '@layout/default.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}DotKernel 1.2.2 release{% endblock %}

{% block page_title %}
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="post-hero">
            <a href="{{ url('page::blog') }}" class="breadcrumb-back">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
                Back to Blog
            </a>
            <div><span class="eyebrow">Dotkernel</span></div>
            <h1>{{ article.title }}</h1>
            <div class="post-meta">
                <span class="text-muted small">
                    By <a href="{{ path('page::author-resource', {slug: article.author.slug}) }}" class="fw-bold link-dark text-decoration-none">{{ article.author.name }}</a>
                    &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ article.postDate|date('M d, Y') }}
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="wrap post-body-wrap">
        <div class="post-layout">

            {{ include('@partial/left-menu.html.twig') }}

            <article class="article">
                <div class="entry">
Yesterday, we released <strong>DotKernel 1.2.2</strong>. It contains some bug fixes:
<ul>
    <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="http://www.dotkernel.net/view.php?id=31">31</a></span> – captcha errors try catch</li>
    <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="http://www.dotkernel.net/view.php?id=32">32</a></span> – pagination issue</li>
    <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="http://www.dotkernel.net/view.php?id=33">33</a></span> – Admin wrong link</li>
    <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="http://www.dotkernel.net/view.php?id=34">34</a></span> – Acunetix results July 24th ( notices and one fatal error)</li>
    <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="http://www.dotkernel.net/view.php?id=35">35</a></span> – update copyright line in files</li>
</ul>
<!--more-->
For more details see <a href="../changelog/1-2-2/">ChangeLog 1.2.2</a>. To get only the changed files from 1.2.1 to 1.2.2, download the <a href="../download/?did=17">upgrade</a> file

<strong>Note*</strong>: because of the Bug 35, all php files have changed. To see what else has changed, check the <a href="http://www.dotkernel.net/">DotKernel Tracker</a> or the <a href="http://websvn.dotkernel.net/listing.php?repname=DotKernel+ver.+1">DotKernel WebSVN</a> .

<em>P.S.</em> On July 22, 2010 we released <em>DotKernel 1.2.1.</em> You can check the <a href="../changelog/1-2-1/">ChangeLog 1.2.1</a> or download <a href="../download/?did=14">the upgrade 1.2.1</a> zip file.
                </div>

                {{ include('@partial/post-nav.html.twig') }}
            </article>

        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
